{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超在香港童軍大會操致辭，他向青年提出四點期望，包括胸懷家國、放眼世界，希望青年把握國家發展機遇，在大灣區，以至內地的廣闊舞台，砥礪本領、建功立業，在世界舞台上，自信地講好中國故事，講好香港故事。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.945255+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T11:00:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:58:32.225416+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:07.041182+00:00","content_hash":"9453117ae17e8f1857172f640ace4aef806b25b1ea48d663fd16589d9205a634","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}